--- 
Title: German Potato Salad
Servings: 1
Tags: Sidekicks, Homemade, Red Potatoes, Sugar, Oil, Vinegar, Onion
---

Boil @Red Potatoes{5 lbs} until soft & peel while warm

Dice the potatoes

Sprinkle @Salt & @Pepper across

Mix gently & not often. Cover up & let melt together for ~{60 minutes}

Taste & adjust as needed